	Support Customer Service Executives in handling complex customer inquiries and escalations.&amp;nbsp;
	Assist in resolving sensitive customer cases requiring managerial intervention.&amp;nbsp;
	Ensure customers receive timely, professional, and accurate responses across all communication channels.&amp;nbsp;
	Maintain high customer satisfaction by ensuring prompt service delivery.&amp;nbsp;
	Support walk-in customer engagements whenever necessary.&amp;nbsp;


